<Document>
  <name>EpicBreezy Segment 2 (KBRO &gt; KCGC, June 5-13 2026)</name>
  <description>Brownsville TX to Crystal River FL along the Gulf coast, then the Florida tour to Marathon and back up the east coast. 19 legs in N149X, GPS recorded at 1 Hz from the wing GoPros.</description>
